  "content": "<p><span style=\"font-family:helvetica, arial, sans-serif;font-size:18px\">這個模組為 Minecraft 加入了以生物為靈感的全新不死圖騰。這些注入生物生命精華的圖騰，除了像普通不死圖騰一樣能讓玩家免於即死之外，使用時還會產生與其對應生物相關的特殊效果。</span></p><p style=\"padding-left:30px\"><span style=\"font-size:18px;font-family:courier new, courier, monospace\">&nbsp;</span></p><p style=\"padding-left:30px\"><span style=\"font-family:courier new, courier, monospace;font-size:18px\"><span><iframe allowfullscreen=\"allowfullscreen\" src=\"https://www.youtube.com/embed/RZXtAJum0mg?wmode=transparent\" height=\"358\" width=\"638\"></iframe></span></span></p><p><span style=\"font-size:18px;font-family:courier new, courier, monospace\">&nbsp;</span></p><h2>圖騰列表：</h2><p>&nbsp;</p><p><span style=\"font-size:18px\"><strong>爆炸不死圖騰</strong>：啟動時會在玩家周圍產生爆炸。</span></p><p>&nbsp;</p><p><span style=\"font-size:18px\"><img src=\"https://cdn.modrinth.com/data/cached_images/ba2bec0c3872a9b4db5d32cf875c9475d78a42b2.png\" alt=\"爆炸不死圖騰合成配方：8個火藥圍繞一個不死圖騰\"></span></p><p>&nbsp;</p><p><span style=\"font-size:18px\"><strong>骸骨不死圖騰</strong>（骷髏）：啟動時賦予玩家名為「狙擊手」的藥水效果，使投射物傷害加倍。</span></p><p>&nbsp;</p><p><img src=\"https://cdn.modrinth.com/data/cached_images/651774fafd5a3f30ebe668a05a561218d361372d.png\" alt=\"骸骨不死圖騰合成配方：8個骨頭圍繞一個不死圖騰\"></p><p>&nbsp;</p><p><span style=\"font-size:18px\"><strong>傳送不死圖騰</strong>（終界使者）：啟動時將玩家傳送回重生點。</span></p><p>&nbsp;</p><p><img src=\"https://cdn.modrinth.com/data/cached_images/8c9a4b06d7f0cb8f285745e3a45294d66ca4c7f3.png\" alt=\"傳送不死圖騰合成配方：4個終界珍珠和4個終界之眼圍繞一個不死圖騰\"></p><p>&nbsp;</p><p><span style=\"font-size:18px\"><strong>幽靈不死圖騰</strong>（地獄幽靈）：啟動時賦予玩家漂浮、緩降與抗火效果。</span></p><p>&nbsp;</p><p><img src=\"https://cdn.modrinth.com/data/cached_images/09535200751aecfb16e5789ddf2dbdd805c94880.png\" alt=\"幽靈不死圖騰合成配方：8個幽靈之淚圍繞一個不死圖騰\"></p><p>&nbsp;</p><p><span style=\"font-size:18px\"><strong>螫刺不死圖騰</strong>（蜜蜂）：啟動時召喚5隻蜜蜂協助玩家抵禦敵人。</span></p><p>&nbsp;</p><p><img src=\"https://cdn.modrinth.com/data/cached_images/a617db56afd83376fa4528a098f4df75f4879b67.png\" alt=\"螫刺不死圖騰合成配方：8個蜂蜜塊圍繞一個不死圖騰\"></p><p>&nbsp;</p><p><span style=\"font-size:18px\"><strong>觸手不死圖騰</strong>（魷魚）：啟動時賦予玩家自訂藥水效果「頭足類」以及原版的海靈祝福效果。「頭足類」效果會讓攻擊玩家的敵人陷入失明與緩速，同時讓玩家攻擊的敵人陷入失明。</span></p><p>&nbsp;</p><p><img src=\"https://cdn.modrinth.com/data/cached_images/eb5c477bb58390d268d5c147c2d0022c2dcdc83e.png\" alt=\"觸手不死圖騰合成配方：8個墨囊圍繞一個不死圖騰\"></p><p>&nbsp;</p><p><span style=\"font-size:18px\"><strong>腐爛不死圖騰</strong>（殭屍）：啟動時召喚3隻友方殭屍協助玩家抵禦敵人，並賦予玩家獨特的藥水效果「壞死」。「壞死」效果使玩家能從傷害藥水和劇毒藥水中恢復生命值，但使用治療藥水和恢復藥水時反而會失去生命值。</span></p><p>&nbsp;</p><p><img src=\"https://cdn.modrinth.com/data/cached_images/6c58b06132fddff1b7e150a825f2dfadf1f83aeb.png\" alt=\"腐爛不死圖騰合成配方：8個腐肉圍繞一個不死圖騰\"></p><p>&nbsp;<span style=\"font-size:18px;font-family:courier new, courier, monospace\"><br></span></p><p><span style=\"font-family:helvetica, arial, sans-serif\"><span style=\"font-size:18px\">需求：</span><span style=\"font-size:18px\">Fabric API</span><span style=\"font-size:18px\"><br></span></span></p><p><span style=\"font-family:helvetica, arial, sans-serif\"><span style=\"font-size:18px\">Curios API 相容性附加元件：</span><span style=\"font-size:18px\"><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/more-curios-totems-of-undying\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/more-curios-totems-of-undying</a></span></span><span style=\"font-size:18px\"><span style=\"font-family:courier new, courier, monospace\"><br></span></span></p><p>&nbsp;</p><p><span style=\"font-family:helvetica, arial, sans-serif\"><span style=\"font-size:18px\">紋理由以下人員製作：<br> <a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fx.com%252fNarynotnarold%253ft%253d2hClpsI8TWfZZpXgESL61Q%2526s%253d09\" rel=\"nofollow\">Narynotnarold</a> <br> <a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fx.com%252fEvoliRavioli%253ft%253dvf2uX3O1O8lnrFoo87xq6Q%2526s%253d09\" rel=\"nofollow\">EvoliRavioli</a></span></span></p><p style=\"padding-left:30px\"><span style=\"font-size:18px;font-family:courier new, courier, monospace\">&nbsp;</span></p><p style=\"text-align:center\"><span style=\"font-size:18px\"><em><em>立即前往 Kinetic Hosting，享受超值又省心的 Minecraft 伺服器租用服務！</em></em></span></p><p><a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fbilling.kinetichosting.net%252faff.php%253faff%253d587\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img style=\"display:block;margin-left:auto;margin-right:auto\" src=\"https://i.imgur.com/OVfuXg1.png\" alt=\"Cyborg Pigeon 的 Kinetic Hosting 推廣連結\"></a></p>",
